---
---
<section class="learns feat--white section">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h2 class="h-section center on-sky" data-reveal>Cora learns you inside and out</h2>
    <div class="learns__grid">
      <div class="learns__card" data-reveal>
        <span class="learns__icon">◑</span>
        <h3>Cora gets to know you, automatically</h3>
        <p>Cora reads your email patterns to discover who you are — your work, your style, and your priorities — without a single form to fill out.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="learns__card" data-reveal style="--reveal-delay:.12s">
        <span class="learns__icon">✦</span>
        <h3>Shape Cora through conversation</h3>
        <p>Talk to Cora like your chief of staff over chat or email. Explain how you want emails filed and situations handled. It remembers everything that matters.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="center" data-reveal style="--reveal-delay:.2s">
      <a href="#pricing" class="btn btn--filled">Get Started <span class="arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .learns { padding: clamp(64px, 10vw, 128px) 0; }
  .learns h2 { margin-bottom: clamp(36px, 5vw, 56px); }
  .learns__grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    gap: 24px;
    margin-bottom: 44px;
  }
  .learns__card {
    background: #fff;
    border-radius: var(--radius-cards);
    padding: 32px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 12px;
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-elev);
  }
  .learns__icon {
    font-size: 22px;
    color: var(--color-cerulean-sky);
    width: 46px; height: 46px;
    display: grid; place-items: center;
    background: #f0f6fd;
    border-radius: 12px;
    margin-bottom: 6px;
  }
  .learns__card h3 { font-size: 20px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--color-ink); }
  .learns__card p { font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.55; color: var(--color-graphite); }
  @media (max-width: 720px) {
    .learns__grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  }
</style>
